"""Packed and batched lookups on a fresh merge of Savant r3.

The packed path prefills Π once, then one forward holds many blocks. Each block's positions restart at |Π|,
and a block-diagonal mask lets it see only Π and itself. The batched path repeats Π in every row. Both are
bf16 SDPA, the same runtime as the pinned tick.

